<title>UK: European jet drops with gas oil futures.</title>
<headline>European jet drops with gas oil futures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>NWE jet fell again on Thursday, pressured by weaker IPE gas oil and lacklustre premiums.</p>
<p>March IPE gas oil closed $1.25 a tonne lower at $164.50.</p>
<p>Traders said activity remained thin with talk of jet barges around March IPE gas oil +$22/23 fob ARA and cargoes holding around the mid $20s cif NWE.</p>
<p>Most buyers appeared relaxed and were waiting for the market to bottom out.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8980</p>
</text>
